hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"22683","Muhammad ibn Ja'far narrated to us, Shu'bah narrated to us, from Yazid ibn Abi Ziyad, from Sulayman ibn Amr ibn al-Ahwas, from his mother, that she witnessed the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, at the Aqabah pillar with the people stoning, and he said: O people, do not kill yourselves, or do not destroy yourselves, and stone the pillar, or the pillars, with the like of pebbles for flicking, and Shu'bah pointed with the tip of his forefinger."
